{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/32125-obtenebration-and-the-strix","id":32125,"title":"Obtenebration and the Strix","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-17T20:35:09-08:00","id":32125,"title":"Obtenebration and the Strix","content":"How does Shadow Play effect the Strix? And what about Shadow Form? How should it change in regard to the new Strix Chronicles?<br /> <br /> Shadow Play can reshape, diminish, and strengthen shadows? Does that mean it could harm a Strix? Or even strengthen them?<br /> <br /> Could a vampire in Shadow Form diablerize a Strix in much the way they diablerize one another or vice versa?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T23:12:38-08:00","id":32189,"title":"","content":"Yes, it can harm a Strix. the khaibit's background as anti-spirit warriors? Those weren't Spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-17T23:21:05-08:00","id":32193,"title":"","content":"I meant more specifically, like could successes on shadow play (Obtenebration 2) do bashing damage to the Strix against say its resistance attribute? Or what about the diablerie question? Strix ARE vampires after all, and as a shadow form, they are in the same physical state.<br /> <br /> Could Shadow Play be used to 'physically' control a Strix?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":460,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","user":"Rani Neferet","date":". 12-18-2013, 02:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/460-rani-neferet","name":"Rani Neferet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar460_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"971"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T03:06:30-08:00","id":32252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dave Brookshaw</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/32125-obtenebration-and-the-strix?p=32189#post32189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, it can harm a Strix. the khaibit's background as anti-spirit warriors? Those weren't Spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>I figured that one out when I noticed this new Strix writeup's <i>tight</i> focus on Strix as shadow-creatures described in prose not unlike that used to describe Obtenebration in the past. <i>Finally</i> something that makes the Khaibit make as much sense as they deserve.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T11:28:19-08:00","id":32590,"title":"","content":"Are the Kaibit and Obtenebration inside the update? If so, it migjt mean I have to get this after all... Because I am lookong at Obtenebration, but not for vampires... Still need it, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1493-roshenrodesh","name":"RoshenRodesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T11:30:09-08:00","id":32593,"title":"","content":"The Khaibit and Obtenebration are not inside Blood &amp; Smoke.<br /> <br /> Edit: Despite the various odd ways Blood &amp; Smoke has been marketed, including the mindbending &quot;sourcebook&quot; designation on the front cover, B&amp;S isn't an &quot;update&quot; as much as it's a completely new corebook. The fact that it is even more self-contained than the original Requiem book, containing the entirety of the WoD core rules as well, only adds to this conclusion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-18T11:33:24-08:00","id":32598,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sikker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/32125-obtenebration-and-the-strix?p=32593#post32593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Khaibit and Obtenebration are not inside Blood &amp; Smoke. Edit: Despite the various odd ways Blood &amp; Smoke has been marketed, including the mindbending &quot;sourcebook&quot; designation on the front cover, B&amp;S isn't an &quot;update&quot; as much as it's a completely new corebook.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks for the info. Since I havr Bloodlines: The Hidden already, I am all set it seems. I just wondered if there was an update, that's all...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1493-roshenrodesh","name":"RoshenRodesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1493_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-23T10:19:01-08:00","id":35651,"title":"","content":"If you want something on Strix and Khaibit, check out the final chapter of Fall of the Camarilla - there are some very interesting easter eggs there.<br /> <br /> Also, Felix in the clanbooks, pay attention to that bastard and some dots will connect very, very fast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":".  adding something i forgot. 12-23-2013, 01:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T05:09:06-07:00","id":485322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/32125-obtenebration-and-the-strix?p=35651#post35651\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you want something on Strix and Khaibit, check out the final chapter of Fall of the Camarilla - there are some very interesting easter eggs there.<br /> <br /> Also, Felix in the clanbooks, pay attention to that bastard and some dots will connect very, very fast.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks for this. I've only just seen you post, because I've only just started to use the forum again, now I have a computer with an up-to-date browser that can view it...<br /> <br /> I don't have the Clanbooks, but if I get hold of the Mekhet one, I'll look Felix up. He clearly is of interest: Why was he spared, when his siblings disappeared? And what happened to his Sire?<br /> <br /> Questions, questions...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1493-roshenrodesh","name":"RoshenRodesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1493_2.jpeg